<title>UK: Scruttons warns on H1 profit,sees H2 rebound.</title>
<headline>Scruttons warns on H1 profit,sees H2 rebound.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Britain's Scruttons Plc said on Wednesday its first-half, pre-tax results would be &quot;very substantially below&quot; year-ago figures due to lower-than-expected turnover in its Freight Ferry Services and Industrial Surface Protection units.</p>
</text>
